      * RPG III multiple-occurrence data structure and OCUR (FREE-20)
     H
     ICUSTDS       DS                         10
     I                                        1  30 CNAME
     I                                        31 372CBAL
     IPLAIN        DS
     I                                        1   5 PFLD
      * Set the occurrence, read it, both
     C                     Z-ADD2         WANT    30
     C           WANT      OCUR CUSTDS
     C                     OCUR CUSTDS    CUR     30
     C           3         OCUR CUSTDS    CUR
     C           WANT      OCUR CUSTDS    CUR
      * Not converted
     C           WANT      OCUR CUSTDS                 90
     C           WANT      OCUR PLAIN
     C           WANT      OCUR NODS
     C                     OCUR CUSTDS
     C           PLAIN     OCUR CUSTDS
     C                     OCUR CUSTDS    BAD     52
